May He protect us both together; may He nourish us both together;
May we work together with great energy;
May our study be vigorous and fruitful; may we never hold dislike for one another.
Om Peace, Peace, Peace.

May Mitra be propitious to us, and Varuṇa; may Aryaman be propitious to us;
May Indra and Bṛhaspati be propitious to us; may the wide-striding Viṣṇu be propitious to us.
Om Peace, Peace, Peace.

Om, the physical plane, the subtle atmospheric realm, and the celestial sphere of light.
We meditate upon the adorable, radiant splendor of the divine Savitur (the creative source of all light);
May He illuminate, awaken, and guide our intellects toward the highest Truth.
